is the capacity of the gallery for private events?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Our 3,000 square foot gallery can accommodate up to 250 guests for a standing reception or approximately 100 for a seated dinner, depending on the current exhibition layout.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/rootdivision.org\/about\/the-space\/venue-rental\/#faq-question-1775771001784","position":2,"url":"https:\/\/rootdivision.org\/about\/the-space\/venue-rental\/#faq-question-1775771001784","name":"Can I choose my own caterer for my event?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely! We have an open vendor policy, allowing you to bring in the caterer of your choice. Events with alcohol sales must have a licensed caterer. We can also provide a list of preferred local vendors familiar with our space.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/rootdivision.org\/about\/the-space\/venue-rental\/#faq-question-1786136444371","position":3,"url":"https:\/\/rootdivision.org\/about\/the-space\/venue-rental\/#faq-question-1786136444371","name":"Does Root Division provide event insurance?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"All events not co-hosted by Root Division require event insurance. We've partnered with <a href=\"https:\/\/www.theeventhelper.com\/#helc89\"><strong>Event Helper<\/strong><\/a> to simplify the process. Get started <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.theeventhelper.com\/#helc89\">here<\/a>.<\/strong>","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/rootdivision.org\/about\/the-space\/venue-rental\/#faq-question-1788213970668","position":4,"url":"https:\/\/rootdivision.org\/about\/the-space\/venue-rental\/#faq-question-1788213970668","name":"Are there any required deposits?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A 50% non-refundable deposit is required at contract signing to secure your date, with the remaining balance due 14 days prior to your event. We also hold a $500 refundable security deposit (collected with final payment) to cover potential damage or late load-outs.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/rootdivision.org\/about\/the-space\/venue-rental\/#faq-question-1788214333202","position":5,"url":"https:\/\/rootdivision.org\/about\/the-space\/venue-rental\/#faq-question-1788214333202","name":"Are there additional staffing fees?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"All venue rentals include one dedicated Root Division Site Manager. To cover additional staffing, events with over 100 guests incur a $100 fee per additional 25 guests. For events bringing in food and beverage, a flat $250 cleaning fee applies. Setup and use of our PA system requires an additional $150 A\/V tech fee.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/rootdivision.org\/about\/the-space\/venue-rental\/#faq-question-1775770984949","position":6,"url":"https:\/\/rootdivision.org\/about\/the-space\/venue-rental\/#faq-question-1775770984949","name":"Is the venue ADA accessible?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Root Division is fully ADA accessible. We are located on the ground floor with a street-level entrance and accessible restroom facilities.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"}]}</script>
