<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column9873_dc9940-8c kadence-column9873_777914-22 inner-column-1"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<p class="has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph"><strong>RENTAL OPTION 3:&nbsp;</strong><br>Front &amp; Rear Galleries plus Classroom w/ Kitchenette (2250 sq ft)&nbsp;<br>$2250</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large wp-duotone-unset-1"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="683" src="https://rootdivision.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Markys50thBday-79_websize-1024x683.jpg" alt="Photo by Nohea Photography" class="wp-image-23167" srcset="https://rootdivision.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Markys50thBday-79_websize-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://rootdivision.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Markys50thBday-79_websize-300x200.jpg 300w, https://rootdivision.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Markys50thBday-79_websize-768x512.jpg 768w, https://rootdivision.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Markys50thBday-79_websize-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://rootdivision.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Markys50thBday-79_websize-600x400.jpg 600w, https://rootdivision.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Markys50thBday-79_websize.jpg 1600w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption"><em><sub>Photo by Nohea Photography</sub></em></figcaption></figure>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column9873_def523-92 kadence-column9873_a8d599-2e inner-column-2"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">• 750 sq. ft.&nbsp; Front Gallery space with natural light opening onto Mission Street;&nbsp;<br>• 1000 sq. ft. Rear Gallery space;&nbsp;<br>• 500 sq. ft.&nbsp; Classroom space with small kitchenette;&nbsp;<br>• 20 ft. ceilings and ADA accessible restrooms.<br>• Capacity 250 (90 seated)</p>
</div></div>

</div></div></div></div>

</div></div></div></div>




<div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id9873_130428-51 alignnone wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-1-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top">

<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column9873_b53023-88 kadence-column9873_3fdcde-65"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<h1 id="FAQ" class="kt-adv-heading9873_1864b3-25 kt-adv-heading9873_2afdd4-0d wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading9873_1864b3-25">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-accordion alignnone"><div class="kt-accordion-wrap kt-accordion-id9873_09ad3c-6f kt-accordion-has-9-panes kt-active-pane-0 kt-accordion-block kt-pane-header-alignment-left kt-accodion-icon-style-basic kt-accodion-icon-side-right" style="max-width:none"><div class="kt-accordion-inner-wrap" data-allow-multiple-open="false" data-start-open="0">
<div class="wp-block-kadence-pane kt-accordion-pane kt-accordion-pane-1 kt-pane9873_a45b0b-45"><div class="kt-accordion-header-wrap"><button class="kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title"><strong><strong>What is the capacity of the gallery for private events?</strong></strong></span></span><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-icon-trigger"></span></button></div><div class="kt-accordion-panel kt-accordion-panel-hidden"><div class="kt-accordion-panel-inner">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our 3,000 square foot gallery can accommodate up to 250 guests for a standing reception or approximately 100 for a seated dinner, depending on the current exhibition layout.</p>
</div></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-pane kt-accordion-pane kt-accordion-pane-4 kt-pane9873_90641b-33"><div class="kt-accordion-header-wrap"><button class="kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title"><strong>Are there any required deposits?</strong></span></span><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-icon-trigger"></span></button></div><div class="kt-accordion-panel kt-accordion-panel-hidden"><div class="kt-accordion-panel-inner">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A 50% non-refundable deposit is required at contract signing to secure your date, with the remaining balance due 14 days prior to your event. We also hold a $500 refundable security deposit (collected with final payment) to cover potential damage or late load-outs.</p>
</div></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-pane kt-accordion-pane kt-accordion-pane-8 kt-pane9873_c8ec9e-ff"><div class="kt-accordion-header-wrap"><button class="kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title"><strong>Is furniture or A/V included with the rental?</strong></span></span><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-icon-trigger"></span></button></div><div class="kt-accordion-panel kt-accordion-panel-hidden"><div class="kt-accordion-panel-inner">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Rentals include basic access to our facility. We offer add-on packages for folding tables, black linens, chairs, and HD projectors. You are also welcome to bring in custom furniture rentals from external vendors. Please refer to our brochure for available items. <strong><a href="https://rootdivision.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/RD-Venue-Rental-Brochure-2026.pdf" data-type="link" data-id="https://rootdivision.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/RD-Venue-Rental-Brochure-2026.pdf">Download Venue Brochure PDF</a></strong></p>
</div></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-pane kt-accordion-pane kt-accordion-pane-9 kt-pane9873_725a1e-06"><div class="kt-accordion-header-wrap"><button class="kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title"><strong>What are the load-in and load-out policies?</strong></span></span><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-icon-trigger"></span></button></div><div class="kt-accordion-panel kt-accordion-panel-hidden"><div class="kt-accordion-panel-inner">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">All setup and teardown must occur within your reserved rental window. If vendors need additional time before or after your event, please ensure your booking includes adequate buffer hours to avoid overtime fees. Events must be loaded out by 11:59 PM.</p>
</div></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-pane kt-accordion-pane kt-accordion-pane-7 kt-pane9873_0566d9-64"><div class="kt-accordion-header-wrap"><button class="kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title"><strong>Can we serve alcohol at our event?</strong></span></span><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-icon-trigger"></span></button></div><div class="kt-accordion-panel kt-accordion-panel-hidden"><div class="kt-accordion-panel-inner">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Yes. Hosted alcohol (free to guests) is permitted for private events. If you plan to sell alcohol or host a ticketed event with alcohol included, California law requires a licensed caterer with an ABC permit or a temporary daily permit.</p>
</div></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-pane kt-accordion-pane kt-accordion-pane-2 kt-pane9873_0b6fb9-49"><div class="kt-accordion-header-wrap"><button class="kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title"><strong><strong>Can I choose my own caterer for my event?</strong></strong></span></span><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-icon-trigger"></span></button></div><div class="kt-accordion-panel kt-accordion-panel-hidden"><div class="kt-accordion-panel-inner">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Absolutely! We have an open vendor policy, allowing you to bring in the caterer of your choice. Events with alcohol sales must have a licensed caterer. We can also provide a list of preferred local vendors familiar with our space.</p>
</div></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-pane kt-accordion-pane kt-accordion-pane-5 kt-pane9873_6149f7-af"><div class="kt-accordion-header-wrap"><button class="kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title"><strong>Are there additional staffing fees?</strong></span></span><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-icon-trigger"></span></button></div><div class="kt-accordion-panel kt-accordion-panel-hidden"><div class="kt-accordion-panel-inner">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">All venue rentals include one dedicated Root Division Site Manager. To cover additional staffing, events with over 100 guests incur a $100 fee per additional 25 guests. For events bringing in food and beverage, a flat $250 cleaning fee applies. Setup and use of our PA system requires an additional $150 A/V tech fee.</p>
</div></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-pane kt-accordion-pane kt-accordion-pane-3 kt-pane9873_84704a-9f"><div class="kt-accordion-header-wrap"><button class="kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title"><strong>Does Root Division provide event insurance?</strong></span></span><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-icon-trigger"></span></button></div><div class="kt-accordion-panel kt-accordion-panel-hidden"><div class="kt-accordion-panel-inner">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">All events not co-hosted by Root Division require event insurance. We&#8217;ve partnered with <a href="https://www.theeventhelper.com/#helc89"><strong>Event Helper</strong></a> to simplify the process. Get started <strong><a href="https://www.theeventhelper.com/#helc89">here</a>.</strong></p>
</div></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-pane kt-accordion-pane kt-accordion-pane-6 kt-pane9873_bee86b-1f"><div class="kt-accordion-header-wrap"><button class="kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title"><strong><strong>Is the venue ADA accessible?</strong></strong></span></span><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-icon-trigger"></span></button></div><div class="kt-accordion-panel kt-accordion-panel-hidden"><div class="kt-accordion-panel-inner">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Yes, Root Division is fully ADA accessible. We are located on the ground floor with a street-level entrance and accessible restroom facilities.</p>
</div></div></div>
</div></div></div>


</div></div>

</div></div>


<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column9873_d7c62d-ee kadence-column9873_7fdf7e-6f inner-column-1"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<h1 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center">SCHEDULE A VISIT</h1>


<div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id9873_04a922-62 alignnone wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-1-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top">

<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column9873_826b65-e8 kadence-column9873_3d931b-e9 inner-column-1"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"><div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id9873_b8faec-03 alignnone wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-1-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top">

<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column9873_8adcf5-08 kadence-column9873_3e8124-c6 inner-column-1"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<p class="has-text-align-left has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph">We require that you (or a representative assigned by you) visit the venue for a walk through prior to reserving the space for an event. To see our gallery and public facility, you are welcome to visit any of our upcoming events and/or during regularly scheduled gallery hours.</p>



<p class="has-text-align-left has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph">For a short tour of the rentable areas, please email <a href="mailto:visit@rootdivision.org">visit@rootdivision.org</a> to schedule Mondays-Fridays between 11 am-6 pm.</p>



<p class="has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph">For additional questions, please email <a href="mailto:venue@rootdivision.org">venue@rootdivision.org.</a></p>
</div></div>

</div></div></div></div>

</div></div></div></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>

	
	
</div><!-- .entry-content .clear -->

	
	
</article><!-- #post-## -->

			</main><!-- #main -->
			
		
	</div><!-- #primary -->


	</div> <!-- ast-container -->
	</div><!-- #content -->
